### Create Customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bank/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mohammed Aslam",
  "email": "aslam@gmail.com"
}

### Create Account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bank/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC123",
  "balance": 1500.00,
  "customerId": 1
}

### Search Customers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bank/customers/search?name=Mohammed&page=0&size=10

### Get Accounts by Email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bank/accounts/by-email?email=aslam@gmail.com

### External Google API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bank/external-google

### Update Customer
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/bank/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mohammed Aslam Updated",
  "email": "aslam.updated@gmail.com"
}

### Delete Customer
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/bank/customers/1
